-# Overrides app/views/order_mailer/_seating_policy.html.haml.
-# Theater Wit's house rules in its own voice, kept verbatim -- including the
-# tears and recriminations, which are load-bearing. The two FACTS in it (doors
-# and phone) are read from the `theater:` block so there is still only one
-# place to change them.
%h5 Seating and Admission
- unless order.performance.production.has_reserved_seating?
  %p
    All seating is general admission. Each show opens its doors #{pluralize(theater_info.doors_open_minutes_before, 'minute')} before curtain time. Our houses are intimate with excellent sightlines, but if you are concerned, you may want to show up on the earlier side for your pick of seats.
    - if order.special_request.blank?
      If you have any special seating requests (wheelchair accessibility, stairs, etc.), please call us at #{theater_info.phone} and we'll do our best to make sure you're taken care of.
    - else
      We have your request for
      = order.special_request
      seating.  We will reserve those seats for you.  Look for your name on the seat :)
%p
  %i
    Please note that late seating is
    %b
      not
      = 'necessarily' if order.performance.production.allow_late_seating?
      available.
  Please make plans to be at the theater at least ten minutes before curtain to avoid tears and recriminations.
</p>
